@startuml
title DeFi360 — Diagrama de Secuencia Maestro (flujos reales · Release 01)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB

actor       "Usuario"                       as User
boundary    "Frontend (React SPA)"          as Frontend
control     "authController"                as Auth
control     "marketplaceController"         as Market
control     "loanController"                as Loan
participant "AuthService\nMockWalletConnector" as AuthSvc
participant "priceOracle (Singleton)\nCachedPriceOracle→SimulatedOracleAdapter" as Oracle
participant "CollateralService\nLTVCalculatorService\nLoanFactory\nStandardPaymentProcessor" as Services
database    "PostgreSQL\n(Sequelize models)" as DB

== HU-01 · Autenticación Web3 (POST /api/auth/connect-wallet) ==

User -> Frontend : Clic "Conectar Wallet"
Frontend -> Auth : POST /api/auth/connect-wallet { walletAddress }
Auth -> AuthSvc : connect(walletAddress)  (DIP IWalletConnector)
AuthSvc --> Auth : sesión simulada OK
Auth -> DB : User.findOne / create + Wallet.create
DB --> Auth : user + wallet
Auth -> AuthSvc : issueToken(user.id)  (JWT)
AuthSvc --> Auth : token
Auth --> Frontend : 200 { token, user, wallet }
Frontend --> User : Dashboard

== HU-03 · Visualizar Marketplace (GET /api/marketplace/offers) ==

User -> Frontend : Abre Marketplace + filtros
Frontend -> Market : GET /api/marketplace/offers?type&minApy...
Market -> DB : Offer.findAll(where, include User)
DB --> Market : List<Offer>
loop por cada offer con colateral
    Market -> Oracle : getPrice(collateralType)
    Oracle --> Market : precio (HIT/MISS caché TTL)
end
Market --> Frontend : { offers enriquecidas (collateralValueUSD, ltv) }
Frontend --> User : Render de ofertas

== HU-04 · Publicar Solicitud de Préstamo (POST /api/loans/request) ==

User -> Frontend : Solicita préstamo { amount, duration, collateral }
Frontend -> Loan : POST /api/loans/request (JWT)
Loan -> Services : CollateralService.calculateValue(type, amount)
Services -> Oracle : getPrice(collateralType)  (DIP)
Oracle --> Services : precio
Services --> Loan : collateralValue
alt collateralValue < amount
    Loan --> Frontend : 400 { Colateral insuficiente }
else colateral suficiente
    Loan -> DB : Offer.create(type='borrow', status='active')
    DB --> Loan : offer
    Loan --> Frontend : 201 { offer }
end
Frontend --> User : Solicitud publicada

== HU-07 · Pago de Cuotas (POST /api/loans/:id/pay) ==

User -> Frontend : Paga cuota { amount }
Frontend -> Loan : POST /api/loans/{id}/pay (JWT)
Loan -> Services : StandardPaymentProcessor.processPayment\n{ loanId, amount, borrowerId }
Services -> DB : Loan.findByPk(include Offer)
DB --> Services : loan
note right of Services
  Resuelve lender/borrower del préstamo:
  resolvedLenderId = lenderId ?? loan.lenderId
  (fix bug Fase A)
end note
Services -> DB : update Wallet(borrower-) / Wallet(lender+)
Services -> DB : Loan.update(remainingBalance, ltv, status)
DB --> Services : OK
Services --> Loan : { newRemainingBalance, newLTV, loanStatus }
Loan --> Frontend : 200 { receipt }
Frontend --> User : Saldo y LTV actualizados

== HU-08 · Monitoreo de Riesgo y Alertas (MonitorRiesgo · setInterval) ==

note over Services : RiskMonitoringService crea MonitorRiesgo(LTVRiskStrategy)\ny suscribe LogObserver + NotificationObserver
loop startMonitoring(loan, priceOracle, intervalMs)
    Services -> Oracle : getPrice(loan.collateralType)
    Oracle --> Services : precio actual
    Services -> Services : LTVRiskStrategy.evaluate(amount, collateralValue)
    alt LTV ≥ 95% (CRITICAL) o LTV ≥ 90% (HIGH)
        Services -> Services : MonitorRiesgo._notifyObservers(event)
        Services --> User : NotificationObserver (alerta)
        Services -> Services : LogObserver (auditoría en memoria)
    end
end

@enduml
